<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51331" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχνό-φωνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thin-voiced,
			weak-voiced</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				2.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).186
			</span></i>; of Isocrates, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.837a
			</span></i>; of partridges, <i><span class="en">
				Antig.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; but, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>having an impediment in one's speech</i> (connected by the
			Greeks with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴσχω</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, οἱ ἰ. . . ἴσχονται τοῦ φωνεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					903a38
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				895a15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				905a21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				100
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. καὶ τραυλός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.155
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. καὶ βραδύγλωσσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ex.</u>
					4.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ezek.
				<u>Exag.</u>
				114
			</span></i>; also of metals, etc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσὸς καὶ λίθος ὑπὸ πληρότητος ἰ.
					καὶ δυσηχῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.721c
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ φιλία ἰ. γέγονεν ἐν
				τῷ παρρησιάζεσθαι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				89b
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φώνως</span> Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.108B.
			</span></i></div>
